<title>USA: Gannett Co Q1 net income per share rises.</title>
<headline>Gannett Co Q1 net income per share rises.</headline>
<dateline>ARLINGTON, Va. 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.96		    $0.64</p>
<p> Net			135,064		   89,350</p>
<p> Revs		   1,076,757		1,023,883</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 141,421		  140,680</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTES: Q1 1997 operating net income per share was $0.96 vs $0.62 a year ago. Q1 1996 results reflect net gain of $0.02 per share from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>First Call estimate for Q1 1997 was $0.92.</p>
</text>
